    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Share the audit folder, battery report, fuel level confirmation, and FASTag status with your chosen service—whether it is Vinayaka Packers and Movers Kurnool, a top packers &amp; movers in Bangalore, or any provider listed in the packers and movers list in Bangalore.</p>
