    <span>This signature serves as legal proof that the handover criteria have been satisfied and that any future claims must reference this signed document</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>
<p>By adhering to this three‑step protocol—daylight re‑inspection, odometer verification, and signed sign‑off—logistics providers create a transparent, auditable trail. The process minimizes disputes, protects asset value, and reinforces trust between all parties involved in the two‑wheeler and motorcycle supply chain.</p></div>
