      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport from Bangalore</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a motorcycle by rail from Bangalore to Kurnool requires a set of specific documents that ensure the journey is smooth, legal, and fully covered. Below is a concise checklist of the essential paperwork, followed by an explanation of the 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance that protects your bike during the entire trip.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self‑attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A clear, self‑attested copy of the Registration Certificate (RC) is mandatory. The RC proves ownership and the vehicle’s legal registration. The self‑attestation confirms that the copy is true to the original, which rail authorities and insurers rely on for verification.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current Pollution Under Control (PUC) Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Rail transport regulations require a valid PUC that is no older than 30 days. The PUC confirms that the bike meets the emission standards and is road‑legal. A photocopy of the original certificate, signed by the owner, should be included.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The bike must be insured under a policy that covers both road and rail transit. The insurance certificate should detail the coverage limits, policy number, and the insurer’s contact information. Ensure that the policy is active at the time of departure.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Indian Railways’ Inter‑modal Bill of Lading (IBA bilty) is the official consignment document for rail freight. It records the consignor, consignee, description of goods, and the agreed freight charges. The bilty must be signed by both parties and stamped by the rail depot.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Once these documents are in order, you can proceed to book a freight space with the rail freight office or a licensed carrier. The carrier will issue a transport order that references the IBA bilty and attaches the insurance certificate for audit purposes.</p>

<p><strong>100% Declared‑Value Marine Transit Insurance</strong> is an optional but highly recommended coverage for high‑value or delicate motorcycles. This policy guarantees that the full declared value of the bike—up to the amount specified in the policy—is reimbursed in the event of loss, damage, or theft during transit.</p>
<p>Unlike standard third‑party policies that pay a fixed sum or a percentage of the value, 100% declared‑value coverage ensures you receive the exact amount you declared, providing peace of mind and financial protection for the entire journey.</p>

<p>In summary, the self‑attested RC, current PUC, valid insurance certificate, and IBA‑approved consignment bilty form the backbone of a compliant and insured rail transport of your bike from Bangalore to Kurnool. Adding the 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance gives you comprehensive protection against any unforeseen mishaps.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



